  "description": "Sole Monorepo AI & Unified Context-Optimized MCP Owner (OpenAI / MCP / A2A / ACP / Triad / Soul / Brain / Memory / Sessions / Skills / Google Cloud & Workspace / CUDA / n2b-REA) in pure oven-sh/bun v1.4.4",
  "type": "module",
  "exports": {
